        },
        {
          "text": "Heeko wák oo Ba'al-shalishár daáhh Elisha heé Mungú guri mikaátér mibeeri tsár i huúw, ar taa tleéhh ar balángw geera oo kurkudá' oo angaánoó shayiri nee qiintár angaáno ar guniyadu iwa hatsiya'. Elisha Gehasi guri báy, «Haniiseek dír muu ka /ayi.» ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
